    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλᾰμ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
