				Hsch.
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλᾰμαῖον</span></b> , τό, a small <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέττιξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
